## `Rc`/`Arc`: el C generado muestra el thunk, el retain y el release.
import std.consortium
import std.spark

rune Node:
    value as int

weave main into int:
    var n as Node is with value is 5
    var a as Rc of Node is calling Rc.new with n
    var b as Rc of Node is a
    var c as Arc of Node is calling Arc.new with n
    var d as Arc of Node is calling c.clone
    calling spark.println with "{calling a.strong_count}{calling c.strong_count}"
    return 0
